# tldw stores API keys in chrome.storage.local via the Settings screen, NOT in a
# build-time env file. This file exists only to document the providers involved.
#
# OpenRouter — summaries, and audio transcription by default (Gemini multimodal).
# A single key covers everything. Get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# OpenAI — OPTIONAL. Only if you switch the audio fallback to Whisper in Settings.
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
